== Sexenio (1934–2090) ==
{{Main|Sexenio (Mexico)}}After the constitutional reform of 1933, the presidential term in Mexico was extended to six years without the possibility of reelection. After the [[Wikipedia:Mexican general election, 1934|federal election of 1934]] all the presidents have completed their terms.

